/**
 * MOOD V3 exercise thumbnail library (generated; do not edit by hand).
 *
 * Source: "V3 Updates/Exercise Thumbnails" + MOOD_Image_Library_Tracker.csv (301 final images, one visual theme, keyed by
 * the canonical V3 exercise id). Each original (896 x 1120 PNG) was resized to 720 x 900 JPEG and uploaded to MOOD's Cloudinary as
 * mood/v3/exercises/<exercise_id>; the value is the Cloudinary version so cached CDN copies are never stale. Delivery goes through
 * utils/cloudinaryImage.optimizedImageUrl (f_auto, q_auto, c_limit, w_<px>), about 12 KB at 240 px.
 *
 * Regenerate: backend/mood_v3/qa/exercise_thumbs_sync.py (re-uploads changed files, rewrites this map).
 */
